 {
  "file": "data/talents/spells/alter-spells.lua",
  "line": 1471,
  "src": "Surround your minions in a veil of darkness. The darkness will teleport them to you, and grant them %d%% evasion for 5 turns.\nAlso reaches through the shadows into quieter places, summoning %d harmless creatures.\nThose creatures are then cursed with a Curse of Hate, making all hostile foes try to kill them.\nIf the summoned creatures are killed by hostile foes, you have 70%% chance to gain a soul.\nThe evasion chance will increase with your Spellpower.",
